src/generated/
.claude/handoff/

# Draft-queue answer scratch files (scripts/social-drafts.mjs answer --ar/--en)
.tmp-draft-*.txt

# Browser-capture and auth debris — NEVER commit these.
# 2026-08-19: pt.json carried two live, non-expiring Facebook Page tokens into
# this public repo and sat there for four days. Rotated 2026-08-23.
# Snapshots from the Playwright/browser MCP land in ~/.claude/playwright-output;
# these patterns stop a stray copy from ever being staged here.
*token*.txt
*token*.json
pt.json
/consent*.yml
/assign*.yml
/dbpage*.yml
/dbpage*.png
/meta-login*.png
